WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:15.380
Tu habites à Lyon depuis quand ?
How long have you been living in Lyon?

2
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:21.188
Depuis lundi ! Je suis arrivée il y a quatre jours.
Since Monday! I arrived four days ago.

3
00:00:21.288 --> 00:00:25.220
Moi, j'habite ici depuis vingt ans.
I've lived here for twenty years.

4
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.724
Tu n'as jamais habité ailleurs ?
You've never lived anywhere else?

5
00:00:28.824 --> 00:00:34.388
Si, j'ai vécu à Paris pendant deux ans, mais je préfère Lyon.
Yes, I lived in Paris for two years, but I prefer Lyon.

6
00:00:34.488 --> 00:00:37.244
Tu y as travaillé ?
Did you work there?

7
00:00:37.344 --> 00:00:41.636
Oui, pendant six mois, il y a trois ans.
Yes, for six months, three years ago.
